 "render_rule": "ALL SYMBOLS MODE renders this tree at the UNCOMMON setting (every leaf visible); category depth and intra-category page order encode rarity. Each top entry is a category branch whose children are direct, frequency-ordered leaves shown 6 per page (Key 6 = PAGE N pages forward, wrapping via RETURN TO PAGE 1). Closely-related symbols (bracket/quote pairs, +/- families, arrow opposites, degree family, etc.) are kept within the same page of 6. The per-leaf tier is an advisory frequency hint aligned to the page (page 1 = primary, page 2 = primary_alt, page 3+ = uncommon); it drives ordering, not visibility. Emit precomposed NFC verbatim.",
